# ============================================================
# VCS — version control / git status.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### Get VCS base commit
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/vcs/base

### Get VCS status
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/vcs/status

### Get VCS branches
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/vcs/branches

### Get VCS diff
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/vcs/diff

# Optional query params:
# GET http://localhost:4096/api/vcs/diff?file=src/index.ts
